        "notes": "This first round is very basic and is considerably weak when put against some other builds, however the build really picks up as the rounds go on and soon you'll be zipping around the map. \n\nWe pick  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) first to give ourselves that extra boost of healing and damage boosting while we build our cash reserve for future rounds. \n\nYou can honestly play around with the perks you choose for this first round, but I tend to stick with  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6),  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). These allow me a tiny bit of survivability while giving me more power to help my team.",
