        "notes": "Now if you can outright afford it immediately buy  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  This is where our movement build starts to come into play. Buying this early on will allow us to stay alive longer, which in turn helps our team stay alive longer. \n\nIf you don't have enough to buy  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) sell the greens you have in order to get it and then buy back the greens you can still afford if you can. If you're left with only [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  I promise it's okay. \n\nI have had games where I can only have  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  or I can have it as well as two or even three other greens. It really depends on how the first round goes, but buying it second round is important for allowing your movement to get harder and harder to track.",
