        "notes": "Round three is where we pick up  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb), which will allow us more freedom to help our team output damage during our ultimate. \n\nSince we are slowly developing into the wonderful moth we aspire to be, we can use this time to boost our blaster as we wait for further rounds. Sticking to our rare perks in  the weapon category we will buy  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e),  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145), and  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\nIt truly depends on your own playstyle if you want to play more into weapon power or attack speed. Whichever you choose will be beneficial to your team in these next two rounds.",
