        "notes": "Assuming you can afford it, buy  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124). If you can't, sell some blues to buy it and then fill in the rest of your cash with blues and/or greens. \n\nBuying  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) will help your team stay up whether you are ulting or not. This perk is not a mandatory perk for this build. I tend to prioritize buying it when my team is taking too much damage and I need to do something a little extra to help them out. \n\nIf you feel it's not necessary to buy it, then fill in your spaces with more weapon power and/or attack speed.",
