        "notes": "Round five is where our moth moves come into serious play. \n\nThe power we pick for this round is  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) \n\nSell all of your perks except for  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) . Use your cash to buy  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) and  [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931). \n\nIf you have enough cash left over buy  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7). If not, fill in the space with blues and greens. \n\nThe reason I wait until round 5 to get my moth moves going, is  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) and  [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) go hand in hand in hand with  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591). They work beautifully together and you'll get the most value out of your rezzes if you use all three together.",
